  "-756214458": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1029835639,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Heh, I've shared this story with you many times, but sure, here it goes. I was working as a car repairman when your {M}  thought I had messed up her car.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2126354426": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1029835639,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "I assured her I hadn't, but she insisted we take it for a test drive. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-171891527": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1029835639,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So, we did, and by the end of the day, we were at the beach, enjoying ice cream and talking about our dreams.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "questions"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1516089871": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -745800824,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It was my first job as a CEO, and I failed. My reputation took a big hit, and I've already applied for over twenty jobs, all of which have turned me down. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1638348372": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 454812426,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "I'll be honest with you, things aren't looking good right now. I might have to consider divorcing Anna to protect her from the consequences of my financial mistakes.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "questions"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-120372093": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 400879512,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "There's no one with the financial means to help us out of this situation. Well, there is one person, but I'd really rather not reach out to her...",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "questions"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1771306320": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -745800824,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "But I'll keep trying. You know how it is – never give up.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "questions"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
